[{"title":"口号","author":"周馨桂","text":"杜诗韩笔昔人论，鸿爪岂宜泥雪痕。\n欲向斯言下转语，诗惟太白笔龙门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19691,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀二首 其一","author":"周馨桂","text":"落日山川未洗兵，秋风豺虎卧连城。\n遗黎空叹瞻乌屋，大将谁思渡木罂。\n世事宜今如水下，人心望古似河清。\n不才未必堪时用，一任浮萍托此生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19692,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀二首 其二","author":"周馨桂","text":"高风永矢硕人宽，浊世谁能青眼看。\n霜落蒹葭犹有色，雪浓松柏不知寒。\n一时毁誉成何事，千载声名俟盖棺。\n未死犹堪自鞭策，任伊陆海日狂澜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19693,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"周馨桂","text":"黾勉年年慕古人，穷途落魄志难伸。\n山中只是无名氏，世上谁为一个臣。\n蹈海鲁连能有耻，穷居原宪本安贫。\n从今陋巷无馀事，且向烟波理钓纶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19694,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闭户二首 其一","author":"周馨桂","text":"闭户人不知，雄心问安在。\n明月入空阶，相将数千载。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19695,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闭户二首 其二","author":"周馨桂","text":"市尘飞不到，安知赤松子。\n名利久无心，沈沈清溪水。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19696,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿长泾村间","author":"周馨桂","text":"连旬烽火日东西，心若悬旌路欲迷。\n借得茅檐聊寄啸，残宵风雨听鸣鸡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19697,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"独吟道中","author":"周馨桂","text":"和风披拂独行行，对面山光笑若迎。\n日暖春泥滋宿麦，云开溪树听流莺。\n人情一例称贫苦，时事无他识利名。\n莫怪征途无伴侣，此心只与白鸥盟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19698,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"古歌","author":"周馨桂","text":"世乱不求安，家贫不谋食。\n慷慨为苍生，涕泪常忧国。\n四海多风尘，何人补衮职。\n煌煌汉唐朝，岂可黯无色。\n山中无勋业，雄心付翰墨。\n复恐世不容，箧笥缄默默。\n遵养守时晦，天地方闭塞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19699,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"奉呈稼堂外叔舅","author":"周馨桂","text":"久别师资屡自嗟，每同谈笑兴弥加。\n怪来文阵扫吾辈，坐拥高文数百家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19700,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"恭挽稼堂外叔舅五十韵","author":"周馨桂","text":"天道不可知，为善安所望。\n呜呼外叔舅，典型今则亡。\n惟公诵清芬，家学传青箱。\n幼志殊群儿，幼学以病荒。\n洎乎弱冠时，沈思渺难量。\n穷经无岁月，所得务精详。\n锐能穿匕劄，微可穷毫芒。\n授徒苦昼短，篝灯幸夜长。\n鸡鸣读未已，偃息敢在床。\n精神耗盛年，喀血不自伤。\n神耗志益奋，身孱心弥强。\n吐辞摅蕴蓄，沈郁声琅琅。\n维昔辛丑年，文战谁雁行。\n特冠邑多士，材大期栋梁。\n癸卯膺鹗荐，铩羽未翱翔。\n庙堂储硕士，华国须文章。\n天如假公年，世岂弃圭璋。\n辛丑桂与公，驽骥同腾骧。\n蒹葭倚玉树，窃幸有辉光。\n追随十载中，有游必同航。\n所恨居处暂，萍踪同他乡。\n归来无他往，聚首时一堂。\n披豁遗俗物，儒修蕲颉颃。\n方期百载内，长此奉瓣香。\n藉公策我惰，庶几道可臧。\n讵知旧疾作，才偏与命妨。\n栖迟尚客路，二竖缠膏肓。\n赖得贤主人，高义郁中藏。\n不赀费不惜，但惜愿未偿。\n他乡我始归，闻命趋公旁。\n未及接晤晤，泪落已浪浪。\n况闻沈痛言，令我割愁肠。\n佳儿学未成，寿母哀难忘。\n目视不受含，吁嗟乎彼苍。\n平生历苦辛，所志唯显扬。\n自矢力虽惫，不得怯文场。\n双眼辣姜桂，孤骨淩风霜。\n性含满腔血，固存未许彰。\n接物多道气，智圆行则方。\n犹忆五月时，言志欣共商。\n叹我不谐俗，笑谓兼狷狂。\n谬许虽滋愧，谈心实非常。\n诚服夙师事，师资今茫茫。\n寒日风萧萧，送公归北邙。\n益觉此生浮，世事付徜徉。\n永念公所命，寸心自可将。\n仁人必有后，积善无馀殃。\n诺公我何恃，恃公可致祥。\n陈箧发手泽，笔墨流馀芳。\n神留公自在，卓哉文已昌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19701,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春晚二首 其一","author":"徐庭翼","text":"独携春酒玩花枝，袅袅东风褪粉脂。\n黄鸟亦知春易逝，尽情啼到月明时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19702,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春晚二首 其二","author":"徐庭翼","text":"粉蝶不同春色去，黄鹂啼罢日初长。\n杨花落地须人埽，好倩东风吹莫狂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19703,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋风引","author":"徐庭翼","text":"一夜西风急，声如班马鸣。\n开门寻不见，梧叶舞纵横。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19704,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题薛氏别业","author":"徐庭翼","text":"门枕黄岐道，斋临绿水边。\n偶来相对坐，日暮不知还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19705,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏竹","author":"徐庭翼","text":"名称君子美如玉，节禀生初身不屈。\n直到淩霄未有心，清虚如此自超俗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19706,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戍妇","author":"徐庭翼","text":"工商农圃尽谋生，谁教郎君去作兵。\n一自金陵行役后，落花啼鸟总关情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19707,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"五月菊","author":"徐庭翼","text":"端阳误认作重阳，秋景何如夏景长。\n岂恨霜天多冷淡，故将花共石榴芳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19708,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏有感","author":"徐庭翼","text":"当户南山特送青，薰风披拂到閒庭。\n龙门分薄书仍读，萤案情浓酒未醒。\n燕语梁间怜旧垒，鸥飞水面戏新萍。\n日长不管寻常事，独倚南窗听午铃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19709,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初至常州登太平塔","author":"徐庭翼","text":"未破浮生梦，观光驾客舟。\n龙城初寄迹，雁塔且閒游。\n登览江山胜，吟怀品物稠。\n周郎驰骛地，黄菊几番秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19710,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋游石湾二首 其一","author":"徐庭翼","text":"载酒携囊海上游，石湾风景正当秋。\n晴开万井新洲近，水落千寻古岸浮。\n席帽峰前看舞鹤，仙人桥畔听吟鸥。\n主人醉倒不知返，直羡渔翁弄钓舟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19711,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋游石湾二首 其二","author":"徐庭翼","text":"数里云冈花鸟閒，一声渔笛起前湾。\n清光骇目浑无地，翠色横空别有山。\n守洞老猿惊客唳，傍沙雏鹜弄潮还。\n西风万顷江涛涌，红叶纷纷晚照间。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19712,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访友不遇","author":"徐庭翼","text":"门设亦常关，幽人尚未还。\n盘桓松树下，惟见白云闲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19713,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"嫠妇","author":"徐庭翼","text":"皎皎中天月，夜夜照独宿。\n问爷胡不归，强笑安儿哭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19714,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄方文蔚","author":"徐庭翼","text":"忆昔谈诗问道微，欣看桃李尽芳菲。\n从今一别春风帐，冉冉馀香犹在衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19715,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"芦花","author":"徐庭翼","text":"芦花冉冉弄斜晖，十月江天似雪飞。\n说与行人休践踏，好将收拾赠无衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19716,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋思","author":"徐庭翼","text":"气爽天高兴也长，雨馀庭院作新凉。\n云归犹带奇峰势，稻熟宜思佳酿香。\n谋道岂因求富贵，忘名省得著文章。\n有何遂我平生志，一棹烟波寄水乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19717,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵李笠翁伊园十宜 其一 阴","author":"徐庭翼","text":"柳烟深锁护花开，妒杀鸣鸠倦枕催。\n园小未留春日住，墙高不碍海云来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19718,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵李笠翁伊园十宜 其二 雨","author":"徐庭翼","text":"小溪碧水涨横滩，蓑笠渔翁钓晓寒。\n良友最宜天晚宿，好山犹爱雨馀看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19719,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日遣兴","author":"徐庭翼","text":"历历浮生等似鸥，何庸名利挂心愁。\n无钱风月偏宜赏，有菊园林尽可游。\n稻熟湖田非素食，衣成家杼胜轻裘。\n时招邻里同盟友，何必仙山访隐流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19720,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻变","author":"徐庭翼","text":"散步春郊上，愁添世变中。\n发看今日白，花似旧年红。\n涂炭凭谁拯，烽烟到处同。\n无知枝上鸟，来往埭西东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19721,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"无家","author":"徐庭翼","text":"一片残阳树，归飞鸟自如。\n依栖鸣上下，羡尔尚安居。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19722,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄居河西食荞麦歌","author":"徐庭翼","text":"荞麦荞麦生成速，凉风播去霜飞熟。\n开花结子一何易，为饱凶荒人饿腹。\n庚申四月干戈扰，全家九口奔沙岛。\n归来冷露滴枯秧，万里西风飘奥草。\n踉跄来就老农商，及时荞麦莫徬徨。\n千钱一斗买渡江，三升一亩布忙忙。\n连宵甘露下高秋，密密银花开满畴。\n黑黍枝枝压倒头，刈来不亚稻粱收。\n磨成洁白粉如玉，饔飧朝夕何颦蹙。\n老娘莞尔笑颜开，吾媳能炊无米粥。\n齑里花团光泽美，盐摊焦饼脆香齿。\n儿童雀跃闹喧哗，争叫爷娘不胜喜。\n分甘击缶发浩歌，人生乱世本凶多。\n既逢小丑免网罗，饥饿幸未填沟河。\n歌罢仰天风萧萧，妻孥破涕聊解嘲。\n一番情事话清宵，把笔挑灯记美荞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19723,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书窗见鼠昼行戏作","author":"徐庭翼","text":"识得好生化机，从来不伤微蚁。\n公然坦荡无妨，何必藏头露尾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19724,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日有感","author":"徐庭翼","text":"难留佳节去匆匆，悲掩柴扉叹道穷。\n三径荒凉烽火后，一樽懒把寂寥中。\n疾风惊断哀鸿侣，暴雨娇添蔓草丛。\n四十一年成底事，黄花对我笑篱东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19725,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小桥夜雨","author":"徐庭翼","text":"羁枕潇潇夜雨稠。\n涛声争渡小桥头。\n吟蛩萧瑟千林起，旅客凄凉百事愁。\n宿鸟惊飞欣脱网，游鱼腾跃幸离钩。\n虽居沙土无兵马，梦里犹疑战鼓擂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19726,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"甲子五月十七日有友数人见访戏作","author":"徐庭翼","text":"喜得承平可住家，连年烽火眼惊花。\n不知嘉客如云集，疑是长毛来索茶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19727,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"暑窗书怀","author":"徐庭翼","text":"雨过炎威退，风生暑气蠲。\n茅编兵乱屋，禾秀劫馀田。\n病久疏杯酌，年衰惜简篇。\n时哉亦运也，随遇养吾天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19728,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"惜书","author":"徐庭翼","text":"圣贤经典素心珍，讵肯轻抛借与人。\n未必眼前无季布，只因去后有仪秦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19729,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答周邦翰","author":"徐庭翼","text":"盈床曾被火于秦，断简残编分外珍。\n爱似王凝非我志，行如江禄是谁循。\n友经离乱情逾密，书为遗亡读倍亲。\n赏识共欣攀五柳，三都愿快一番新。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19730,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春阴","author":"徐庭翼","text":"九十阳春景，阴霾大半残。\n不胜拖屐苦，犹道拥炉寒。\n鼓听催花未，风看解冻难。\n不知新柳眼，何事泪阑干。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19731,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼友胡型","author":"徐庭翼","text":"悠悠不返逝川之，脉脉无期感梦思。\n回忆留看东岭月，那堪重读北风诗。\n文才敏捷谁追步，雅操清廉最可师。\n黉翰蜚声何足道，举家殉节著芳仪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19732,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立秋偶吟二首 其一","author":"徐庭翼","text":"西风昨夜到吾庐，槛外炎蒸势尽除。\n从此清凉无热客，最宜幽暇理残书。\n栽将桃李都森立，话到桑麻更自如。\n莫负一年秋好处，梧桐叶落晚晴馀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19733,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立秋偶吟二首 其二","author":"徐庭翼","text":"小次西村两载馀，舌耕幸得代犁锄。\n飘飖梧叶身犹似，变幻浮云事亦如。\n炎势终为秋气肃，閒情端向晚凉舒。\n优游明月清风夜，喜听儿童读草庐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19734,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"徐庭翼","text":"省得炎窗暑课馀，寻凉林下步徐徐。\n一群鸟集黄梿树，又向先生来背书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19735,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有感","author":"徐庭翼","text":"无情常在有情先，何用多情测未然。\n月缺月圆原是月，天晴天雨总由天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19736,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"友至","author":"徐庭翼","text":"我友都从淡以成，家贫不必厚相迎。\n冷茶待客虽非礼，薄酒斟人也是情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19737,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游山梦","author":"徐庭翼","text":"东风款款夜窗推，高枕青山入梦来。\n不似希夷忘岁月，亦非刘阮入天台。\n高山景仰兴徘徊，洞口红桃笑我来。\n借问此中谁是主，閒云自在徬花隈。\n苔径弯环绝点埃，峰峦如画锦屏开。\n一行绿字深深见，点画分明近体裁。\n何缘有梦作良媒，适见山书实快哉。\n说与儿童浑不解，晓窗磨墨把诗催。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19738,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三月晦夕赏芍药","author":"徐庭翼","text":"秉烛携樽就药栏，今宵莫作等閒看。\n凭谁计好留春住，常对花容尽醉欢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19739,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"楝花二首 其一","author":"徐庭翼","text":"楝花品列众香中，我笑前人太不公。\n二十四番绝以此，也应羞愧对春风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19740,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"楝花二首 其二","author":"徐庭翼","text":"终于楝子始于梅，花圃应羞与并栽。\n蜂蝶知无香艳采，纷纷飞过粉墙来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19741,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西村赏荷","author":"徐庭翼","text":"小池一亩素荒芜，我来始植荷与蒲。\n又被鹅鸭牛践污，连岁未克花舒敷。\n今年行禁约牧奴，水清花发美且都。\n薰风浪涌青钱输，不日如云荫绿蒲。\n朵朵潘妃连步起，亭亭翠盖争前趋。\n香腾清远入天衢，盘盘晓露湛明珠。\n岂惟艳冶绝尘区，风光堪拟小西湖。\n朝来暮往陂塘隅，花容偏与老人娱。\n可怜境僻赏客稀，往往取酒独倾壶。\n画工今代未应无，倩绘莲房百子图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19742,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"口占戏赠张君达二首 其一","author":"徐庭翼","text":"摘拾随园几句诗，东涂西抹辄忘痴。\n春风道上挥纨扇，写秃张颠笔一枝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19743,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"口占戏赠张君达二首 其二","author":"徐庭翼","text":"莫嫌此际花垂树，宽俟他年果满枝。\n种树类培佳子弟，亟期成就本非宜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19744,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳烟二首 其一","author":"徐庭翼","text":"溪畔谁家放晓烟，如丝如缕绕前川。\n多情最是东风好，吹上青云触碧天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19745,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳烟二首 其二","author":"徐庭翼","text":"只为春来阴雨绵，烹茶常怕湿柴煎。\n晴窗忽见溪边柳，犹讶邻炊起暮烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19746,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"口占谕三郎","author":"徐庭翼","text":"秋风忽送海棠香，费我踌躇好护藏。\n看向月中将桂折，管教携手咏霓裳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19747,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西村赏荷","author":"徐庭翼","text":"老年分外把花怜，不管花羞对老年。\n临镜未曾悲白发，俯池偏欲爱红莲。\n淩波绿叶看无厌，绕岸朱华别有妍。\n知我诗肠无绮语，盈盈含笑水帘前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19748,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"原韵和琴川萧石芗先生自挽诗","author":"缪仲诰","text":"星芒倏掩少微寒，束笋遗文戢戢攒。\n金石同贞徽不沫，琴樽徒具座无欢。\n春和族被膏腴赡，秋赋人方矍铄看。\n惆怅巫阳招太急，临风东望有馀酸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19749,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送八弟宝斋入都应试","author":"谢高育","text":"正值分龙日，江干送汝行。\n无言堪禁泪，少语倍含情。\n事业穷而达，文章老更精。\n吾身久衰朽，风雨盼成名。\n有侄犹能教，无烦问课程。\n午餐描字仿，卯饮听书声。\n慈爱非疏节，陶镕可大成。\n解元桥畔望，北榜报锣鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19750,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题沈节母寡鹄轩遗草","author":"谢高育","text":"宜人费尽一生心，寡鹄诗成亘古今。\n题咏每多情与景，劝惩倍切孝和淫。\n自天有耀来纶綍，掷地无惭作石金。\n四十馀年经历处，乐哀都付短长吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19751,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送刘谦山邑尊奉调赴省二首 其一","author":"郑惇五","text":"截灯持靴拥不前，人人都道使君贤。\n独欣垂老逢三善，共惜沾恩只六年。\n薤本拔时豪族詟，蒲鞭用罢讼庭悬。\n清风归去山氓识，无事耶溪选一钱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19752,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送刘谦山邑尊奉调赴省二首 其二","author":"郑惇五","text":"柳拂离筵怅若何，惟馀棠荫播舆歌。\n心劳抚字催科拙，时际艰难调护多。\n无计留春三月住，仅偿借寇一年过。\n摩挲老眼看新政，但祝重来聚衮萝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19753,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"君山怀古和曹秉生","author":"章永基","text":"三千年事一伤神，难问前因与后因。\n黄土何心理季子，青山无泪哭春申。\n带横绝壁天为堑，斗大孤城地有垠。\n我为陈思一惆怅，等閒飘泊苦吟身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19754,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"颂刘谦山邑侯德政五首 其一","author":"杨希三","text":"治法胥缘理与情，理情兼尽政斯平。\n四方但觉安耕凿，终岁相传少讼争。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":19755,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]